            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Старый матрос рассказывал нам о море. Stáryy matrós rasskázyval nam o móre. The old sailor told us about the sea."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine. Моряк is anyone who works at sea; матрос (matrós) is a deckhand or a junior rank."
            }
